ll_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/zipball/1.5.1","body":"## What's Changed\r\n* Reject inverted single-byte Range like `bytes=5-4` by @nikolauspschuetz in https://github.com/encode/starlette/pull/3389\r\n* Limit `FileResponse` to 100 ranges by @Kludex in https://github.com/encode/starlette/pull/3430\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/encode/starlette/compare/1.5.0...1.5.1\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/367253915/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"mentions_count":2},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/367139868","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/367139868/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/367139868/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/releases/tag/1.5.0","id":367139868,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCELT_M4V4hwc","tag_name":"1.5.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 1.5.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-08-08T07:14:28Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T07:19:04Z","published_at":"2026-08-08T07:19:04Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/tarball/1.5.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/zipball/1.5.0","body":"This release is all about giving `GZipMiddleware` some love. 🗜️\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* Add `exclude_content_types` parameter to `GZipMiddleware` by @Kludex in https://github.com/encode/starlette/pull/3418\r\n* Flush GZip output for each streamed chunk by @Kludex in https://github.com/encode/starlette/pull/3419\r\n* Skip compression of partial responses in `GZipMiddleware` by @Kludex in https://github.com/encode/starlette/pull/3420\r\n* Expand default excluded content types in `GZipMiddleware` by @Kludex in https://github.com/encode/starlette/pull/3421\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/encode/starlette/compare/1.4.1...1.5.0","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/367139868/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"mentions_count":1},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/365619626","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/365619626/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/365619626/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/releases/tag/1.4.1","id":365619626,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"htt