ub.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCELT_M4R4L6i","tag_name":"1.0.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 1.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-03-22T18:21:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-22T18:27:00Z","published_at":"2026-03-22T18:27:00Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/tarball/1.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/zipball/1.0.0","body":"Starlette 1.0 is here! 🎉\r\n\r\nAfter nearly eight years since its creation, Starlette has reached its first stable release.\r\n\r\nA special thank you to @lovelydinosaur, the creator of Starlette, Uvicorn, HTTPX and MkDocs, whose work helped to lay the foundation for the modern async Python ecosystem. 🙏\r\n\r\nThank you to @adriangb, @graingert, @agronholm, @florimondmanca, @aminalaee, @tiangolo, @alex-oleshkevich, @abersheeran, and @uSpike for helping make Starlette what it is today. And to all my sponsors - especially @tiangolo, @huggingface, and @elevenlabs - thank you for your support!\r\n\r\nThank you to all [290+ contributors](https://github.com/encode/starlette/graphs/contributors) who have shaped Starlette over the years! ❤️\r\n\r\nRead more on the [blog post](https://marcelotryle.com/blog/2026/03/22/starlette-10-is-here/).\r\n\r\nCheck out the full release notes at https://www.starlette.io/release-notes/#100-march-22-2026\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/encode/starlette/compare/1.0.0rc1...1.0.0","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/299941538/reactions","total_count":123,"+1":25,"-1":0,"laugh":7,"hooray":49,"confused":0,"heart":23,"rocket":19,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":12},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/289614985","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/289614985/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/289614985/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/releases/tag/1.0.0rc1","id":289614985,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCELT_M4RQyyJ","tag_name":"1.0.0rc1","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 1.0.0rc1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-02-23T22:03:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T22:11:36Z","published_at":"2026-02-23T22:11:36Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/tarball/1.0.0rc1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/zipball/1.0.0rc1","body":"We're ready! 🚀\r\n\r\nThe first release candidate for Starlette 1.0 is here! After years on ZeroVer, we're finally making the jump.\r\n\r\nThis release removes all deprecated features marked for 1.0.0, along with some last-minute bug fixes.\r\n\r\nA special thank you to @lovelydinosaur, the creator of Starlette, Uvicorn, HTTPX and MkDocs, whose work helped to lay the foundation for the modern async Python ecosystem. 🙏\r\n\r\nThank you to @adriangb, @graingert, @agronholm, @florimondmanca, @aminalaee, @tiangolo, @alex-oleshkevich, and @abersheeran for helping make Starlette what it is today. And to all my sponsors - especially @tiangolo, @huggingface, and @elevenlabs - thank you for your support!\r\n\r\nThank you to all [290+ contributors](https://github.com/encode/starlette/graphs/contributors) who have shaped Starlette over the years!\r\n\r\nCheck out the full release notes at https://www.starlette.io/release-notes/#100rc1-february-23-2026\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/compare/0.52.1...1.0.0rc1\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/289614985/reactions","total_count":77,"+1":18,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":36,"confused":0,"heart":9,"rocket":14,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":11},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/277714035","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/277714035/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/277714035/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/releases/tag/0.52.1","id":277714035,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCELT_M4QjZRz","tag_name":"0.52.1","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 0.52.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-01-18T13:33:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-18T13:33:37Z","published_at":"2026-01-18T13:33:37Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/tarball/0.52.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/zipball/0.52.1","body":"## What's Changed\r\n* Only use `typing_extensions` in older Python versions by @Kludex in https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/3109\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/compare/0.52.0...0.52.1","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/277714035/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":1},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/277699429","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/277699429/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/277699429/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/releases/tag/0.52.0","id":277699429,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCELT_M4QjVtl","tag_name":"0.52.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 0.52.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-01-18T10:04:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-18T10:06:30Z","published_at":"2026-01-18T10:06:30Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/tarball/0.52.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/zipball/0.52.0","body":"In this release, `State` can be accessed using dictionary-style syntax for improved type safety ([#3036](https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/3036)).\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom collections.abc import AsyncIterator\r\nfrom contextlib import asynccontextmanager\r\nfrom typing import TypedDict\r\n\r\nimport httpx\r\n\r\nfrom starlette.applications import Starlette\r\nfrom starlette.requests import Request\r\n\r\n\r\nclass State(TypedDict):\r\n    http_client: httpx.AsyncClient\r\n\r\n\r\n@asynccontextmanager\r\nasync def lifespan(app: Starlette) -> AsyncIterator[State]:\r\n    async with httpx.AsyncClient() as client:\r\n        yield {\"http_client\": client}\r\n\r\n\r\nasync def homepage(request: Request[State]):\r\n    client = request.state[\"http_client\"]\r\n    # If you run the below line with mypy or pyright, it will reveal the correct type.\r\n    reveal_type(client)  # Revealed type is 'httpx.AsyncClient'\r\n```\r\n\r\nSee [Accessing State](lifespan.md#accessing-state) for more details.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/compare/0.51.0...0.52.0","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/277699429/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/275744118","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/275744118/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/275744118/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/releases/tag/0.51.0","id":275744118,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOCELT_M4Qb4V2","tag_name":"0.51.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 0.51.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-01-10T20:12:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T20:41:10Z","published_at":"2026-01-10T20:22:32Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/tarball/0.51.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/zipball/0.51.0","body":"## Added\r\n\r\n* Add `allow_private_network` in `CORSMiddleware` [#3065](https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/3065).\r\n\r\n## Changed\r\n\r\n* Increase warning stacklevel on `DeprecationWarning` for wsgi module [#3082](https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/3082).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @santibreo made their first contribution in https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/3082\r\n* @iddqd888 made their first contribution in https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/3083\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/compare/0.50.0...0.51.0","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/275744118/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":2},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/259008008","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/259008008/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/releases/259008008/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/releases/tag/0.50.0","id":259008008,"author":{"login":"Kludex","id":7353520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTM1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7353520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex","html_url":"https://github.com/Kludex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kludex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"h